# Tasks — Scribble Lab

## Group 1: Room Setup & Lobby (Scenario 1)

### Backend
- [ ] T1.1 Add `hostId` to Room model and set on creation
- [ ] T1.2 Add player name validation (trim, reject empty/whitespace)
- [ ] T1.3 Add `POST /rooms/:code/start` endpoint with host validation and 2-player minimum
- [ ] T1.4 Update `toRoomSnapshot` to include `hostId`

### Frontend
- [ ] T1.5 Update API client with `startGame` method and updated types
- [ ] T1.6 Fix API base URL (remove `/bug` suffix)
- [ ] T1.7 Add auto-polling to LobbyPage (~2s interval)
- [ ] T1.8 Show "Start Game" only for host, disabled until ≥2 players
- [ ] T1.9 Add name validation on create/join forms

## Group 2: Game Start & Drawer Flow (Scenario 2)

### Backend
- [ ] T2.1 Add `drawerId` and `secretWord` to Room model
- [ ] T2.2 Implement drawer assignment (host is drawer)
- [ ] T2.3 Implement deterministic word selection
- [ ] T2.4 Update `toRoomSnapshot` to hide word from non-drawers

### Frontend
- [ ] T2.5 Show secret word to drawer only
- [ ] T2.6 Show "Waiting for drawer" to guessers
- [ ] T2.7 Navigate to game on successful start

## Group 3: Gameplay Interaction (Scenario 3)

### Backend
- [ ] T3.1 Add `guesses[]`, `scores{}`, `canvasData` to Room model
- [ ] T3.2 Add `POST /rooms/:code/guess` endpoint with validation and scoring
- [ ] T3.3 Add `PUT /rooms/:code/draw` endpoint for canvas data
- [ ] T3.4 Add `POST /rooms/:code/clear-canvas` endpoint

### Frontend
- [ ] T3.5 Implement interactive drawing canvas (mouse/touch)
- [ ] T3.6 Implement clear canvas button
- [ ] T3.7 Connect GuessForm to API
- [ ] T3.8 Display guess history in ResultPanel
- [ ] T3.9 Display scores in Scoreboard
- [ ] T3.10 Poll game state for canvas and guess updates

## Group 4: Result, Restart & Final Validation (Scenario 4)

### Backend
- [ ] T4.1 Auto-transition to `result` status on correct guess
- [ ] T4.2 Add `POST /rooms/:code/restart` endpoint
- [ ] T4.3 Restart resets round state but preserves participants

### Frontend
- [ ] T4.4 Show result view (correct word, final scores, guess history)
- [ ] T4.5 Show "Play Again" button for host
- [ ] T4.6 Navigate back to lobby on restart

## Dependencies
- T1.x must be completed before T2.x
- T2.x must be completed before T3.x
- T3.x must be completed before T4.x
- Within each group, backend tasks should precede frontend tasks
